{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西紀一九二二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西紀一九\n二五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦得諸尼泊爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十七卷第五號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據萊維校刊．梵本第六七頁多有缺文．餘與藏\n譯出入甚微。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萊維印本順釋所牒頌文．提行排列．頗醒眉目。但仍有小疪應改。如三十五頁第十七頌末句重提兩處．又\n全篇引頌亦復提行．皆生混淆。但此猶無關文旨。若我國舊譯釋論另提論本於前．至於釋文標牒皆不區\n分．因以晦失意義不少。唐譯二十唯識論亦不免此．誠憾事耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如安慧傳本第十頌．列善心所名目無捨．\n但云俱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如第十七頌末句一切唯識．末加是字乃足八言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如第十二頌．六\n煩惱中．見前於疑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如第三四五頌解藏識．凡五以彼字牒前文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如解藏\n識有二頌三句．遞至第八頌解六識遂成單句．不滿一頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如第七頌首句末賸一餘字．屬下\n句觸等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安慧本頌云悔眠亦如是．此亦如\n是三字論無解．即是餘文．改為不定不破頌式。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安慧本云第三若\n六種境能緣者是．多有餘詞．改為性相亦不破頌式。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因此又知新譯唯識諸籍．傳今學本．而譯文敷衍．與舊譯古．本情形畧同。直據\n其文以相是非．固難得其平耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊傳陳真\n諦譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安慧論每云\n復次．即存舊說。轉識論所解．數見安慧論復次文中．其為前出之作可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本乃云性相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐\n譯本餘作實字．乃可云餘及觸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本乃作不定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本\n乃作不思議。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "轉識論。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本乃出無覆無記於後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本具出行捨名目．善法十一．即\n不容異解。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成唯識論卷八．又轉識論。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐譯本所分別下云\n由此彼皆無．義勢則隔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘有多處勘文可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勘下出安慧論文．短長自辨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內院樹因研究室藏本．安土版。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "轉識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身．"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏譯順釋．作彼執受及處．了別不可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頌中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏譯順釋意譯云．與有覆無記．四煩惱常俱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第六頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我癡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第七頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（附記）日人寺本婉雅最近重校藏文三十頌．載於佛教研究七卷三號。謂頌善不善俱非下原缺一句．\n應據釋補云．非有無貪。| Ma-chags-par ldan-pa ma-yin-pa | 按原頌單句．係因前文遞次而然．本無所缺．安用\n其補。且所補云云．隨意連綴．勘梵藏兩本論文．毫無所據。又藏譯頌皆七言一句．今補乃有八字．亦非程式。\n種種乖違．不可置信。又其本餘頌亦謬誤多端．不勝指摘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第九頌．藏譯云．三受彼相應。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十一頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏譯論文於此分卷．上第一卷訖．下題後第二卷。但梵本不分。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十二頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十三頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十四頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恨等體業文繁．不具出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是眠等皆分別說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十五頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見解深\n密經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十六頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十七頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三轉聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五轉聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十八頌．藏譯順釋．顛倒第二三\n句。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十九頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十一頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十二頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十三頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十四頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十五頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十六頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按此是另\n一章句．"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯識性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十七頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十八頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即二取取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二十九頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三十頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔附記〕西藏譯三十頌本一種．亦勝友等譯．亦存安慧之說。本刊第一輯中．已為重譯矣。但對勘此\n論引文．乃見其中錯誤凡有多處。（藏譯中頌本與釋論參差者．時常見之。）自宜依釋訂正．不容異說．今\n不詳舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作者識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T31n1586_p0060b28"}
{"id": null, "n": "0266a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0266a1201", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，己【補編】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0268a1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【補編】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0270a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0270a0501", "type": "add", "text": "諂【CB】，謟【補編】"}
